Q1: Why target the supplier?

The pivot: get into the supplier, then use their trusted access to reach the real target.
It doesn’t look like an attack: traffic from a long-trusted backup supplier doesn’t raise alarms.
Smaller suppliers often have weaker security: a family-run business may have no security staff at all.

